What the diff does:
• Uses yoagent, as the task asked. doctor_api.rs builds the same model config a real run uses (via create_model_config) and sends one request through yoagent's provider. It sorts failures by yoagent's own error types, not by parsing strings, and the whole request is capped by a timeout.
• Wired in the right place. The check is added in handle_doctor, not inside run_doctor_checks, so the existing unit tests of the pure checks make no network calls. Both callers were updated: the REPL in dispatch.rs and yoyo doctor in dispatch_sub.rs.
• Size gate met. commands_dev.rs is now 1978 lines, under the 2000 cap.

